      "content": "PICCOTT'S END 1. 5252                                                   (West Side)                                                   Piccott's End Mill House TL 0409 8/219             20.5 54. TL 0509 8/219 II                       GV 2. Late C18 red brick house with Welsh slated roof behind parapet  Basement and 3 storeys, cornice.  4 sash windows with glazing bars under cutter flat arches. Doorway left of centre has attached Doric columns supporting entablatures and cornice hood.  6 panelled door and fanlight with radiating glazing bars in panelled reveal. Piccott's End Mill House and Mill form a group. Listing NGR: TL0500609210"
